"Supported types vary with vehicle (Plane only supports ADSB). Some kinds of "
"avoidance require external hardware, such as ADSB receivers or  "
"Rangefinders."
msgstr "支持的类型因飞行器而异（固定翼仅支持 ADSB）。某些避障类型需要外部硬件，例如 ADSB 接收机或测距仪。"

